{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1085687-mage-armor-rules","id":1085687,"title":"Mage Armor Rules","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-29T21:37:49-07:00","id":1085687,"title":"Mage Armor Rules","content":"I feel a little dense asking, because I am sure it is here somewhere, but just where in the book do I find the rules for Mage Armor? I found the rules for activating it (p193), and I can see lots of other Shielding effects, but not actual rules for the armor itself. Is it just implied to work like regular armor? If so, which type?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1547-bunnirabbi","name":"BunniRabbi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1547_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T21:56:00-07:00","id":1085692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BunniRabbi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1085687-mage-armor-rules#post1085687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel a little dense asking, because I am sure it is here somewhere, but just where in the book do I find the rules for Mage Armor? I found the rules for activating it (p193), and I can see lots of other Shielding effects, but not actual rules for the armor itself. Is it just implied to work like regular armor? If so, which type?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's in the individual Arcana descriptions for the Attainment; each Arcanum works differently. Forces and Matter Armor work most like regular Armor ratings, while Fate, Mind, Space, and Time add their ratings to your Defense in a manner that applies to surprise attacks. (Life splits the difference evenly and gives you animal Defense, Death and Spirit offer non-scaling damage-downgrades, and Prime simply works as magic-exclusive Armor.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T23:56:42-07:00","id":1085722,"title":"","content":"I thought Attainments were always non-spell effects though. As I understood it that was part of the point of Attainments.<br /> <br /> Edit: Never mind. I misunderstood what you said the first time through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1547,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1547-bunnirabbi","user":"BunniRabbi","date":". 04-30-2017, 03:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1547-bunnirabbi","name":"BunniRabbi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1547_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}